msgid "Your project was not posted.\n\n{reasons}\n\nYour saved project information remains available. Proposal preparation must complete successfully before posting."
msgstr "Mradi wako haukuchapishwa.\n\n{reasons}\n\nTaarifa za mradi wako zilizohifadhiwa bado zinapatikana. Utayarishaji wa pendekezo lazima ukamilike kwa mafanikio kabla ya kuchapisha."

